# renki

The launcher half of a two-part command line tool, as a library. A tool is a
`Tool` descriptor and a `main` that hands it over; the crate finds the
repository, reads the pin, builds the engine once into a keyed cache, resolves
the tool's configuration and execs the engine with the result. Unix only, on
`renki-dirs` for where its files go and `renki-config` for what its settings
are.
